title "tab dotted values"
time 4/4
key c major
part gtr { instrument guitar }
section A {
  gtr { e4. f8 g4. a8 | <c e g>2. <d f a>4 | }
}
form main { A }
score main {
  staff gtr
  tab gtr as full
}

// ⚠ THE TAB ASKS FOR `as full` EXPLICITLY (2026-08-29). A tab beside a notation staff
// of the same part now defaults to `as numbers`, which draws no stems, beams, dots,
// tuplet numbers or ties -- and this book is ABOUT one of those, so without the clause
// it would keep passing while testing nothing it claims to.
